# Keys can live in the repo-level .env (shared with app/) or in voice/.env. Uncomment and fill in only what you
# need: an empty value here would hide the repo-level one. Both .env files are git-ignored; never commit them.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# Only if Claude says the key "is not scoped to a workspace": the workspace ID (wrkspc_...) from the Console.
# ANTHROPIC_WORKSPACE_ID=

# Optional voice IDs. Blank uses the stand-ins in agents.py: Eric as the doctor, River for the agents.
# Put the doctor's own cloned voice ID here once we have it.
# ELEVENLABS_DOCTOR_VOICE_ID=
# ELEVENLABS_AGENT_VOICE_ID=

# Filled in automatically by `python agents.py`.
